{"id":1030,"date":"2025-05-22T14:03:48","date_gmt":"2025-05-22T08:33:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/?page_id=1030"},"modified":"2026-03-24T13:12:50","modified_gmt":"2026-03-24T07:42:50","slug":"internal-complaint-committee","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/internal-complaint-committee\/","title":{"rendered":"Internal Complaint Committee"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1030\" class=\"elementor elementor-1030\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-76e20f1 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"76e20f1\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3681771\" data-id=\"3681771\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a8d64b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3a8d64b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Overview<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c2a3cd7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c2a3cd7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In compliance with the Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal) Act, 2013, and the UGC (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal of Sexual Harassment of Women Employees and Students in Higher Educational Institutions) Regulations, 2015, Kaveri University has established an Internal Complaints Committee (ICC) to ensure a safe, inclusive, and respectful environment for all students, faculty, and staff. The ICC is committed to the prevention and redressal of complaints related to sexual harassment and gender-based discrimination, promoting a campus culture based on dignity, equality, and mutual respect.<\/p><p>The Internal Complaints Committee at Kaveri University serves as a cornerstone of the institution\u2019s commitment to gender justice, human dignity, and inclusive education. Through proactive measures and responsive mechanisms, the ICC plays a vital role in upholding a respectful and secure campus for all.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5571bad elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5571bad\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e181250\" data-id=\"e181250\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5a2f89d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5a2f89d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Objectives<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a2ec7e3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a2ec7e3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>To prevent, prohibit, and address incidents of sexual harassment at the university<\/li><li>To uphold the rights of individuals to work and study in an environment free from gender-based harassment<\/li><li>To create awareness and sensitization on gender equity and respectful conduct<\/li><li>To ensure prompt, impartial, and confidential handling of complaints<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-13fbbe0 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"13fbbe0\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e227d08\" data-id=\"e227d08\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a3ecf9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3a3ecf9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Composition of the ICC<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-77daa75 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"77daa75\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>As per statutory norms, the ICC at Kaveri University comprises:<\/p><ul><li>Presiding Officer: Dr. R. Jagadeshwar<\/li><li>Faculty Members: Dr. A. Pratap Kumar Reddy and Dr. K. Srinivas<\/li><li>Non-Teaching Staff Representative\u2013G. Nagaraju<\/li><li>External Member: Epur Anil Kumar<\/li><li>Student Representatives: M. Bhargavi<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-049305b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"049305b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-565d542\" data-id=\"565d542\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e7793f6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e7793f6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Functions of the ICC<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-842d7a6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"842d7a6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li>Complaint Handling<ul><li>Receive and examine complaints related to sexual harassment<\/li><li>Conduct fair, impartial, and timely inquiries following due process<\/li><li>Recommend disciplinary action or remedial measures to the university authorities<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li>Awareness and Sensitization<ul><li>Organize gender sensitization workshops, training programs, and interactive sessions<\/li><li>Disseminate information on rights, responsibilities, and procedures related to sexual harassment<\/li><li>Display posters and resource materials across the campus for visibility<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li>Policy Implementation<ul><li>Advise the university on policies and procedures related to gender equity and workplace ethics<\/li><li>Monitor adherence to UGC and statutory guidelines<\/li><li>Submit annual reports to the Vice Chancellor and UGC on complaints received and actions taken<\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-931163b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"931163b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e2e2dd7\" data-id=\"e2e2dd7\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-742e720 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"742e720\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Redressal Process<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cb4a7ab elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cb4a7ab\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Any aggrieved woman (student, faculty, or staff) may file a written complaint to the ICC within three months of the incident<\/li><li>The ICC conducts a confidential and impartial inquiry, following principles of natural justice<\/li><li>The inquiry must be completed within 90 days, and recommendations implemented within 30 days<\/li><li>Both complainant and respondent have the right to be heard and to present evidence<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-405100a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"405100a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-cf47a6a\" data-id=\"cf47a6a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f79ee0f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f79ee0f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ensuring a Safe Campus<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21fb503 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"21fb503\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Kaveri University maintains a zero-tolerance policy towards sexual harassment and is committed to creating a secure and supportive space for women. The ICC operates independently and with complete confidentiality, ensuring that all individuals feel empowered to report grievances without fear of victimization.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Overview In compliance with the Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal) Act, 2013, and the UGC (Prevention, Pr&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"templates\/Internal Complaint Committee.php","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-1030","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.2 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Kaveri University | Courses in Agricultural Studies | Telangana<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kaveri University offers UG, PG, and Doctoral Programs in Agricultural Sciences, Technology, Food and Nutrition, Agribusiness Management, Forestry etc.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/internal-complaint-committee\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Kaveri University | Courses in Agricultural Studies | Telangana\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description